// Full auto runs a prompt job only when an agent is present.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE agent ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG agent rank

IMPULSE agent 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "agent" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
